cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TFP in research, please cite this software repository."
title: "TFP — Traveling Fox Problems"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "TFP Contributors"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A compact PyTorch research framework for deep reinforcement learning,
  local robotic decision-making, reproducible behavior analysis, and
  lightweight model/controller experimentation under partial observation.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - deep reinforcement learning
  - robotics
  - partial observability
  - PyTorch
  - behavior analysis
